  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023Beyond &amp; Constructive Institute - New Narratives for Africa, 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aligns with Denmark&#x2019;s Africa Strategy by promoting nuanced narratives about Africa. By fostering collaboration between Danish and African media professionals, it will strengthen mutual understanding and support the exchange and innovation of journalistic practices. This contributes to the Africa Strategy&apos;s focus on inclusive and equal partnerships with African Countries.</narrative>
  </description>
